  "title": "Sophia J NDE 7818",
  "date": "Août 1994",
  "content": "After a fall from a horse, I come to, but I was up high in the corner of the emergency room. I am quite shocked to see myself lying on my stomach. Then I was in front of my grandfather, who passed the year before. I feel good and I want to stay. But my grandfather tells me that I have to return and that everything will be okay. We were bathed in a kind of green halo. My grandfather is sitting on his tomb. I don't feel my body anymore. I refuse to go. It seems that time stopped. Then I wake up in my hospital bed. This experience is difficult to put into words.",
